# Trivy CVE ignore list for Alpine base image (mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspnet:10.0-alpine)
# These are OS-level vulnerabilities with no upstream fix or not exploitable in FunkArr.

# libaom: remote code execution via SVC layer context handling with attacker-controlled frames
# Not exploitable: FunkArr remuxes only, does not encode AV1
CVE-2026-56211

# libaom: heap-buffer-overflow read via missing bounds check in ctrl_set_layer_id
# Not exploitable: FunkArr remuxes only, does not encode AV1
CVE-2026-56210

# libaom: arbitrary address write via SVC layer context OOB and cyclic refresh map pointer hijack
# Not exploitable: FunkArr remuxes only, does not encode AV1
CVE-2026-56209

# libaom: heap buffer overflow in AV1 encoder first-pass stats buffer via LAP mode
# Not exploitable: FunkArr remuxes only, does not encode AV1
CVE-2026-56208
